Package: intercapsule
Type: Package
Title: Interaction-First Capsule Glyphs
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Iman", "Sadeghi", email = "i.sadeghi@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Multimodal biological interactions are rendered as compound capsule glyphs encoding direction, mechanism, magnitude, and evidence quality in a single object.
    Part of the glyphome suite of ten complementary visualization modules
    for advanced bioinformatics analysis and publication-grade figures.
